 "_comment": "Non-AD function catalogue for tools/build_architecture.py (schema v3). One entry per function cluster of the AUTOSAR Application Interfaces explanatory documents (names as in the documents), with the sensors and actuators it reads / drives, its bus, the ASIL used for its safety-critical components, the base period class (ms) and the number of software components the document decomposes it into (counted from the decomposition figures / SW-C lists; 'est' = our estimate where the document gives no decomposition). Sources per entry. The generator expands every function by the scale factor into components with CARIAD distributions. Functions with 'mem_mb' are POSIX / Android / Adaptive applications on an application processor: the MB ranges are the memory of the whole function (application or service group), drawn log-uniformly once per function and shared equally by its generated components, instead of the CARIAD classic-AUTOSAR kB ranges per SW-C; they are excluded from the TC39x memory calibration (2026-10-23). System totals as anchors: Android Automotive device >= 816-1,824 MB RAM per display and >= 4 GB /data (Android 15 CDD 2.5.1); AGL demo 2 GB RAM; TCU 512 MB / 8 GB.",
